{title: Be Still And Know}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
1. Be still and know that He is God:
He breaks the mighty bow,
And causes all the wars to cease
Upon this world below.

Verse 2
2. Be still, my soul, and give Him time
To speak a Word to me,
To draw me closer to His side,
And help mine eyes to see... to see...

Verse 3
3. That truly He is LORD of All,
Beginning and the End,
Redeemer of the soul of man,
And my Eternal Friend.
